From u96353e7106735838 at groups.google.com  Wed Jan 31 12:50:46 2018
From: u96353e7106735838 at groups.google.com (Karl Broman)
Date: Wed, 31 Jan 2018 12:50:46 +0000
Subject: Re: [Rqtl-disc] MQM interval
Message-ID: <iDpbnmRx9Mo.kozQTB1sAAAJ@rqtl-disc.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <iDpbnmRx9Mo.CeoWDVE5AQAJ@rqtl-disc.groups.google.com>
